        },
        "unchanged_gate": "All other authored values, root/model/table/column/instance metadata and table order type-exact from accepted parent; TFDT stays0, two wave DTIM1, NREPS1, seed1, SIMPE36, RCINT.5/RCEND36, ENLOG Y, mission DURN1 and TFOUT/TFRET each dimensionless fraction .25. Never normalize native export or alter source after failure.",
